            "heading": "",
            "text": "Career guidance matters in high school because early exploration helps students choose subjects and streams with open eyes, and the most useful form is simple: try activities, talk to working people, learn how courses link to jobs and keep options open."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Use classes 9 to 12 to explore interests, build basic skills and understand what courses lead to, instead of choosing a final career."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check the current official notices for the courses you consider."
          }
